      "content": "it wasnt just regular bursts tho. earlier tonight it got way more intense. i was sitting near the router and it felt like a heavy, low-end thrumming, almost like a heartbeat, but it had this sharp, staccato clicking overlaid on top of it. like... thrum-thrum-thrum, click-click-click, thrum-thrum-thrum. it felt way more organized than just a video stream. almost like it was trying to signal something specific. does that pattern mean anything more complex? like a handshake or some kind of encrypted sync?",
